WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Emily: Hi!

00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
Neighbor: Hey there!

00:04.000 --> 00:07.000
Emily: How's your morning going?

00:07.000 --> 00:09.500
Neighbor: Good, thanks!

00:09.500 --> 00:11.500
Neighbor: And you?

00:11.500 --> 00:14.500
Emily: I'm doing pretty good, just heading to work.

00:14.500 --> 00:16.500
Neighbor: Have a good one!

00:16.500 --> 00:18.000
Emily: You too, see you around!
